{"id":"c2fbfa4145581e14","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-thm-diamond-plus-equivalent.md","title":"$\\Diamond^+$ Equivalents","display":"thm-diamond-plus-equivalent — $\\Diamond^+$ Equivalents","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-diamond-plus-equivalent","aliases":["58-thm-diamond-plus-equivalent"],"display":"thm-diamond-plus-equivalent — $\\Diamond^+$ Equivalents","depends_on":["[[58-df-diamond]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-diamond-plus-equivalent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-diamond-plus-equivalent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-diamond-plus-equivalent — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond^+\">\\(\\Diamond^+\\)</span> Equivalents"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d60e0a36bd259287\" href=\"?note=d60e0a36bd259287\" title=\"58-df-diamond\">58-df-diamond</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,S,C,\\vec{\\mathcal A}\\in V,\\quad S\\subseteq\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa,S,C,\\vec{\\mathcal A}\\in V,\\quad S\\subseteq\\kappa\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary},\\mathrm{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary},\\mathrm{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiamondPlus}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{DiamondPlus}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (the principle characterized below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diamond\\text{-}plus} \\vdash \\mathrm{DiamondPlus}_S(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega_1\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\\exists\\vec{\\mathcal A}\\;\\left[\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathcal A},\\kappa,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\mathcal A}))\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\\left(\\vec{\\mathcal A}(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\alpha)\\land|\\vec{\\mathcal A}(\\alpha)|\\leq\\max(\\aleph_0,|\\alpha|)\\right)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in C\\cap S\\;(X\\cap\\alpha\\in\\vec{\\mathcal A}(\\alpha)\\land C\\cap\\alpha\\in\\vec{\\mathcal A}(\\alpha))\\right)\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diamond\\text{-}plus} \\vdash \\mathrm{DiamondPlus}_S(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega_1\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\\exists\\vec{\\mathcal A}\\;\\left[\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathcal A},\\kappa,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\mathcal A}))\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\\left(\\vec{\\mathcal A}(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\alpha)\\land|\\vec{\\mathcal A}(\\alpha)|\\leq\\max(\\aleph_0,|\\alpha|)\\right)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in C\\cap S\\;(X\\cap\\alpha\\in\\vec{\\mathcal A}(\\alpha)\\land C\\cap\\alpha\\in\\vec{\\mathcal A}(\\alpha))\\right)\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiamondPlus}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DiamondPlus}_S\\)</span> implies ordinary diamond; the simultaneous club-guessing clause distinguishes the two principles.</li>\n<li>It does not in general imply failure of square; in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>, diamond-plus and square principles can coexist.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-diamond","status":"resolved","id":"d60e0a36bd259287","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-diamond]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Diamond^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa,S,C,\\vec{\\mathcal A}\\in V,\\quad S\\subseteq\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stationary},\\mathrm{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DiamondPlus}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diamond\\text{-}plus} \\vdash \\mathrm{DiamondPlus}_S(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega_1\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\\exists\\vec{\\mathcal A}\\;\\left[\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathcal A},\\kappa,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\mathcal A}))\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\kappa\\;\\left(\\vec{\\mathcal A}(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\alpha)\\land|\\vec{\\mathcal A}(\\alpha)|\\leq\\max(\\aleph_0,|\\alpha|)\\right)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in C\\cap S\\;(X\\cap\\alpha\\in\\vec{\\mathcal A}(\\alpha)\\land C\\cap\\alpha\\in\\vec{\\mathcal A}(\\alpha))\\right)\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DiamondPlus}_S","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":1717,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4119","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-thm-diamond-plus-equivalent.md|58-thm-diamond-plus-equivalent]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["d60e0a36bd259287","5fb1c2241d1943d1","0fbfc19800246e77","b802c3dd76418d95